  "contentHtml": "<p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">오늘은 &lt;폐품으로 쓸모있는 그 무엇</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"> 만들</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">기&gt;를 주제로 탐구하였습니다.</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">개인적으로 키트로 하는 활동을 싫어하여 원재료(?)를 활용하는 수업 아이디어를 적용하려고 노력합니다.</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">학교 행사를 앞두고 오늘 시정이 조정되었습니다. 35분 수업을 하는 바람에&#160;아이들이 평소보다 힘들어 하더군요. (교과 주제선택 수업은&#160;두 시간 연강으로 오늘은 70분만에 완성하였습니다.)</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">우리 아이들의&#160;작품 일부를 올립니다. </span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">두 번째 작품은 내부에 LED를 넣어 손전등으로 사용하도록 고안하였는데, 오늘은 시간이 부족하여 몸체만 &#160;완성하였습니다.(사진은 다소 부실하게 보이지만 실물은 무지 화려합니다.)</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6b40a528d0049e1858fee7b38a6b81e1d40a726a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6b40a528d0049e1858fee7b38a6b81e1d40a726a\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"768\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99E42C3B5B9F430721\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99E42C3B5B9F430721\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"768\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/994ECC345B9F43171C\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/994ECC345B9F43171C\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"768\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/998AF2405B9F43271F\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/998AF2405B9F43271F\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"768\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99A0713F5B9F433504\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99A0713F5B9F433504\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"768\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/72e9ed7174fe07227f81130cf80710c1a4f4bd6b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/72e9ed7174fe07227f81130cf80710c1a4f4bd6b\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1365\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6eaa20933dba96524183c076dd44e6ce637c873a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6eaa20933dba96524183c076dd44e6ce637c873a\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1365\"></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;&#160;&#160;</span></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
